      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree honestly, allowing users to sit on their own seats would make so many opportunities arise to do awesome things. I'm personally a big fan of the idea of creating your own driveable vehicles, so I hope this feature gets added, I don't see any downsides to doing this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
